==English==
[[File:Turkish - Penknife - Walters 57620.jpg|thumb|Turkish straight penknife]]
[[Image:Small.knife.for.women.jpg|thumb|right|150px|20th-century penknife]]

===Etymology===
From {{inh|en|enm|penne knyfe}}; equivalent to {{compound|en|pen|knife}}. In the original sense, named for its purpose: aiding the use of a (traditional) [[ink pen]] through the following tasks: trimming the tip of a [[quill pen]], trimming a [[reed#Noun|reed]] for a [[nib#Noun|nib]], and (in some cases) allowing [[erasure]] by [[scrape#Verb|scraping]] away some [[ink#Noun|ink]].

